nish university located in Madrid, Spain.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"[1] The university's official language is Spanish, and the majority of its academic programs, including the master's program in which the thesis was written, are taught in Spanish.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Furthermore, the thesis's title, \\\"Análisis de la regulación de la retención de datos en el campo de las telecomunicaciones en la Unión Europea y su encaje en el derecho de la UE\\\", is written in Spanish, suggesting that the language of the thesis is Spanish.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Additionally, the European Union's official languages include Spanish, and the EU's telecommunications regulations, which are the subject of the thesis, are also available in Spanish.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[4] This further supports the claim that the language of the thesis is Spanish.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"[1] Universidad Carlos III de Madrid.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"About Us.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.uc3m.es\\\\/ss\\\\/Satellite\\\\/UC3M\\\\/en\\\\/about-us>\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"[2] Universidad Carlos III de Madrid.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Academic Programs.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.uc3m.es\\\\/ss\\\\/Satellite\\\\/UC3M\\\\/en\\\\/academic-programs>\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"[3] [Author's Name].\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"(Year).\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"Análisis de la regulación de la retención de datos en el campo de las telecomunicaciones en la Unión Europea y su encaje en el derecho de la UE.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"[Master's Thesis].\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"Universidad Carlos III de Madrid.\"},